        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_verify_v1v3",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_verify_v1v3\n\nExport lod_verify_v1v3() for direct testing.\n\nAdd lustre/kunit/lod_verify_test.c, covering lod_verify_v1v3()'s\nvalidation of a user-supplied or on-disk lov_user_md buffer: buffer\ntoo small, bad magic, default-pattern fixup, bad pattern, a released\nlayout's short-circuit, bad stripe size, an offset outside or not in\nthe pool's OST bitmap, an unknown pool (accepted as-is), and a\nstripe count over the pool's target count (rejected); and\nlod_layout_convert()'s rewrapping of a plain lov_mds_md into a\none-entry lov_comp_md_v1 envelope.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5\nChange-Id: Ie75f083ca8ee64eaf1905c3f7e74906d3d8171bd\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
